{"sha": "35e1e5bec1de5bb74960eb5e6675347ce927ec01e33b66e717e82288c045be02", "body": ["\\textbf{3.} 将 $X^n = Q_n D + a_n X + b_n$ 在两根处取值：", "$\\lambda^n = a_n\\lambda + b_n$ 与 $\\mu^n = a_n\\mu + b_n$。", "两式相减，并除以 $\\lambda - \\mu \\neq 0$：", "\\[", "a_n = \\frac{\\lambda^n - \\mu^n}{\\lambda - \\mu},", "\\qquad", "b_n = \\lambda^n - a_n\\lambda", "= \\frac{\\lambda\\mu^n - \\mu\\lambda^n}{\\lambda - \\mu} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{4.} 在二重根处：$\\lambda^n = a_n\\lambda + b_n$。", "对恒等式求导，得 $nX^{n-1} = Q_n'\\,(X - \\lambda)^2", "+ 2Q_n\\,(X - \\lambda) + a_n$，并在 $\\lambda$ 处取值：$a_n", "= n\\lambda^{n-1}$；于是 $b_n = \\lambda^n - n\\lambda^{n} = (1 -", "n)\\lambda^{n}$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} 对 $P = \\sum_i p_i X^i$ 与 $Q = \\sum_j q_j X^j$，", "\\[", "P(M)\\,Q(M) = \\sum_{i,j} p_i q_j M^{i+j} = (PQ)(M),", "\\]", "因为单一矩阵 $M$ 的各次幂彼此可交换", "（和式由线性显然成立）。若 $D(M) = 0$，将 $M$", "代入 $X^n = Q_n D + a_n X + b_n$，得 $M^n = Q_n(M)\\,D(M) + a_n", "M + b_n I = a_n M + b_n I$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} 直接计算乘积：", "\\[", "A^2 = \\begin{pmatrix}", "a^2 + bc & b(a + d)\\\\", "c(a + d) & d^2 + bc", "\\end{pmatrix},", "\\qquad", "s A = \\begin{pmatrix}", "a(a+d) & b(a+d)\\\\", "c(a+d) & d(a+d)", "\\end{pmatrix},", "\\]", "于是 $A^2 - sA$ 的非对角元全为零，对角元为", "$a^2 + bc - a^2 - ad = bc - ad = -p$: $A^2 - sA + pI_2 = 0$.", "", "\\textbf{7.} 设 $A' = \\begin{pmatrix} a' & b'\\\\ c' &", "d'\\end{pmatrix}$，展开得 $p(AA') = (aa' + bc')(cb' + dd') -", "(ab' + bd')(ca' + dc')$：项 $aa'cb'$ 与 $ab'ca'$ 相消，", "项 $bc'dd'$ 与 $bd'dc'$ 相消，余下为", "\\[", "aa'dd' - bca'd' + bcb'c' - adb'c'", "= (ad - bc)(a'd' - b'c') = p(A)\\,p(A').", "\\]", "若 $p \\neq 0$，由凯莱--哈密顿定理得 $A\\,\\bigl(\\tfrac1p(sI_2 -", "A)\\bigr) = \\tfrac1p(sA - A^2) = I_2$，从而得逆矩阵（", "由\\cref{prop:b1:matrices:ring}可知它是双侧的）。若 $p = 0$ 且", "$A$ 可逆，则由乘法性得 $1 = p(I_2) =", "p(A)\\,p(A^{-1}) = 0$：矛盾。故 $A \\in GL_2 \\iff p \\neq 0$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 取 $s = 3$，$p = 2$，$D = X^2 - 3X + 2 = (X - 1)(X -", "2)$：$\\lambda = 2$，$\\mu = 1$，于是 $a_n = 2^n - 1$，且 $b_n = 2 -", "2^n$（第 3 题）。由此", "\\[", "A^n = (2^n - 1)A + (2 - 2^n)I", "= \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2^n - 1\\\\ 0 & 2^n \\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "验算：$A^2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3\\\\ 0 & 4\\end{pmatrix}$ 既可由公式给出，", "也可直接平方算出。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 取 $s = 4$，$p = 3\\cdot1 - 1\\cdot(-1) = 4$：$D = X^2 -", "4X + 4 = (X - 2)^2$，为二重根 $\\lambda = 2$。由第 4 题，$a_n", "= n\\,2^{n-1}$，$b_n = (1 - n)2^n$，于是", "\\[", "A^n = n\\,2^{n-1}A + (1 - n)2^n I", "= 2^{n-1}\\begin{pmatrix} n + 2 & n\\\\ -n & 2 - n", "\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "当 $n = 2$ 时：$2\\begin{pmatrix} 4 & 2\\\\ -2 & 0\\end{pmatrix} =", "\\begin{pmatrix} 8 & 4\\\\ -4 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$，即 $A^2$", "直接计算所得。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 归纳法：$F^1 = \\begin{pmatrix} F_2 & F_1\\\\ F_1 &", "F_0\\end{pmatrix}$，且", "\\[", "F^{n+1} = F^n F =", "\\begin{pmatrix} F_{n+1} + F_n & F_{n+1}\\\\", "F_n + F_{n-1} & F_n \\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} F_{n+2} & F_{n+1}\\\\ F_{n+1} & F_n", "\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "此处 $s = 1$，$p = -1$，$D = X^2 - X - 1$，其根为 $\\varphi,", "\\psi$（$\\varphi - \\psi = \\sqrt5$，$\\varphi\\psi = -1$）。", "数列 $(F_n)$ 满足 $F_0 = 0 = a_0$，$F_1 = 1 = a_1$，且服从", "与 $(a_n)$ 相同的递推式：$F_n = a_n = (\\varphi^n -", "\\psi^n)/\\sqrt5$，即比内公式。卡西尼恒等式：应用第 7 题的", "乘法性于 $F^n$，有", "\\[", "F_{n+1}F_{n-1} - F_n^2 = p(F^n) = p(F)^n = (-1)^n .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{11.} 该条件是线性的，且包含零数列，", "故为子空间。由归纳法，$u_0, u_1$ 线性地决定 $u$，", "且每一对初值都恰好对应", "唯一一个解：仿\\cref{exo:b1:findim:10}，$E_D$", "可由 $(u_0, u_1) \\in K^2$ 双射且线性地参数化：", "$\\dim E_D = 2$.", "", "\\textbf{12.} $(a_n)$ 满足（第 2 题）的递推式，其中 $a_0", "= 0$，$a_1 = 1$。$(b_n)$ 亦然：$b_{n+2} = -p\\,a_{n+1} =", "-p(s a_n + b_n) = s\\,b_{n+1} - p\\,b_n$（两次利用 $b_{n+1} = -pa_n$", "），且 $b_0 = 1$，$b_1 = 0$。组合 $v_n =", "u_1 a_n + u_0 b_n$ 亦为解，且 $v_0 = u_0$，$v_1 =", "u_1$；初值相同的两个解必相等，", "（由归纳法），故 $u_n = u_1 a_n + u_0 b_n$ 对一切 $n$ 成立。", ""]}